(text "CC1101 - TI sub-GHz transceiver. Use the bare IC (QFN-20) plus its reference balun + matching\nnetwork for 433/868/915 MHz. TI app-note DN017 recommends:\n  - 26 MHz crystal (CL = 10pF), 12pF/12pF load caps.\n  - Balun: Johanson 0433BM15A0001 or Murata LDB212G4520C-110 (band-dependent).\n  - Output DC block (10nF), then to PE43711 #1 in the RF front-end sheet (via CC1101_RF).\nDECOUPLING: 100nF + 10nF + 1nF on each VDD pin (4 places).\nGDO0/GDO2 GPIOs go straight to the ESP32 (used for FIFO IRQ and clock-out)."
	(at 100 30 0)
	(effects
		(font (size 1.27 1.27))
		(justify left top)
	)
	(uuid "c61846a4-2a97-4771-8ec9-abeb0ef36696")
)
